  "worked_solution": "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n\\frac{p}{3}\\,,\\,\\frac{2r}{3}\\,,\\,\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\nThe only term with the variable $r$ is $\\frac{2r}{3},$ so $\\frac{2}{3}$ is the coefficient of $r.$",
